  "explanation": "Segment = sector $-$ triangle $= \\frac{1}{2}r^2\\theta - \\frac{1}{2}r^2\\sin\\theta = \\frac{1}{2}r^2(\\theta - \\sin\\theta)$, with $\\theta$ in radians.",
